00:09:01.867 --> 00:09:05.767
Whereas South Portland Little League was founded in 1951 with the first games

00:09:05.867 --> 00:09:09.467
played that year, providing seven decades of youth and family in South

00:09:09.533 --> 00:09:13.467
Portland with the opportunity to participate in organized baseball and softball.

00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.867
Whereas the program grew in the years that followed to include multiple

00:09:17.934 --> 00:09:21.900
local leagues, including South Portland American Little

00:09:21.934 --> 00:09:25.533
League, South Portland National Little League, Sunset Park Little League-

00:09:25.533 --> 00:09:25.867
Yes

00:09:25.900 --> 00:09:28.700
... South Portland Central Little League, reflecting the community's strong and

00:09:28.767 --> 00:09:30.500
sustainable commitment to the Little League.

00:09:31.834 --> 00:09:35.467
Whereas for 75 years, tens of thousands of children in our community have

00:09:35.533 --> 00:09:39.433
developed skills, confidence, teamwork, sportsmanship through participation

00:09:39.467 --> 00:09:43.266
in the Little League programs, including T-ball, baseball, softball, and the

00:09:43.333 --> 00:09:45.567
Challengers Division for players of all abilities.

00:09:46.934 --> 00:09:50.634
Whereas softball programs were established and evolved over time, ultimately

00:09:50.667 --> 00:09:54.634
rejoining Little League to further unify and strengthen youth softball and

00:09:54.667 --> 00:09:55.900
baseball in South Portland.

00:09:57.133 --> 00:10:00.266
Whereas the success and longevity of the South Portland Little League has been made

00:10:00.300 --> 00:10:01.800
possible by the dedication

00:10:03.233 --> 00:10:07.100
of countless volunteers, including coaches, umpires, board members, local

00:10:07.133 --> 00:10:11.033
business sponsors, families who have generously contributed their time and

00:10:11.133 --> 00:10:11.834
resources.

00:10:14.967 --> 00:10:15.367
You're good.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:20.266
Whereas South Portland Little League has played an important role in strengthening

00:10:20.367 --> 00:10:23.834
community pride and providing a safe and inclusive, enriching environment for our

00:10:23.934 --> 00:10:24.734
youth and recreation.

00:10:25.800 --> 00:10:29.500
Whereas the 75th year of South Portland Little League represents a significant

00:10:29.533 --> 00:10:32.367
milestone worthy of recognition and celebration across the city.

00:10:33.266 --> 00:10:36.834
Now be it therefore proclaimed by the City Council of South Portland,

00:10:37.166 --> 00:10:40.767
recognizing the year of 2026 as South Portland's Little League 75th

00:10:40.834 --> 00:10:44.433
anniversary year, and we encourage all residents to join and celebrate this

00:10:44.500 --> 00:10:48.433
milestone in recognizing the lasting impact in South Portland Little League in our

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:49.000
community.

