00:46:09.700 --> 00:46:13.100
would likely have to be updated, or this would be considered a substantive change

00:46:13.667 --> 00:46:16.600
if you did amend it tonight, which would require another second reading.

00:46:18.133 --> 00:46:19.634
I have one final thought there.

00:46:20.066 --> 00:46:23.100
