00:49:30.900 --> 00:49:34.467
come up behind me, I don't hear the noise of the

00:49:34.567 --> 00:49:37.767
bike, the wheels turning, until they're right beside me.

00:49:38.500 --> 00:49:42.100
And I've turned into a little angry old lady who yells,

00:49:42.533 --> 00:49:46.266
"Please call out when you're coming by." A few do,

00:49:46.700 --> 00:49:50.500
but very, very few. And so I've really stopped

00:49:50.600 --> 00:49:54.066
using the Greenbelt, and I think that electronic bikes for

00:49:54.166 --> 00:49:57.900
me are even more dangerous, because they don't make any noise.

00:49:58.300 --> 00:50:02.266
And some of them do go very fast, and the majority do not

00:50:02.400 --> 00:50:04.166
call out when they come by.

00:50:05.000 --> 00:50:05.367
Thank you.

00:50:07.033 --> 00:50:10.500
