04:09:00.233 --> 04:09:01.533
to see the data point filled in.

04:09:02.533 --> 04:09:06.500
Can I suggest that we come back to that amendment, maybe at the end?

04:09:06.600 --> 04:09:06.634
Okay.

04:09:06.634 --> 04:09:10.500
It'll buy me some time. It may be that it was just a PDF export

04:09:10.567 --> 04:09:13.100
problem, and I want to verify if we actually have the data points.

04:09:13.166 --> 04:09:16.900
If we don't, I might be able to come up with the suggestions now,

04:09:17.400 --> 04:09:19.367
and then if you agree to those, we can run with those.

04:09:19.634 --> 04:09:19.834
Okay.

04:09:20.166 --> 04:09:20.400
Okay.

04:09:20.400 --> 04:09:21.367
Okay. Thank you.

