motions or amendments to

04:10:00.934 --> 04:10:04.433
move, but I did want to speak to the plan and just provide some

04:10:04.500 --> 04:10:07.400
commentary, and obviously you folks can move on from there.

04:10:07.600 --> 04:10:11.500
